[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3783.549, "timestamp": "01:03:03", "text": "就像一次重大突破，而且很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3792.069, "timestamp": "01:03:12", "text": "是的，没错。是的。我……我还没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3794.349, "timestamp": "01:03:14", "text": "我决定何时结束"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3798.95, "timestamp": "01:03:18", "text": "喜悦。即使我一直都像这样，嗯，即使"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3802.23, "timestamp": "01:03:22", "text": "虽然我最后一天保留了21号的标记"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3805.63, "timestamp": "01:03:25", "text": "合作合作的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3809.829, "timestamp": "01:03:29", "text": "嗯，我的意思是打包不会那么麻烦，不会的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3812.15, "timestamp": "01:03:32", "text": "花了那么多时间，我可以放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3815.109, "timestamp": "01:03:35", "text": "最后一刻，就像麦克风一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3818.309, "timestamp": "01:03:38", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。我不知道。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3821.19, "timestamp": "01:03:41", "text": "就像想象你永无止境一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3822.87, "timestamp": "01:03:42", "text": "巧克力。剩下的时间就一直这样下去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3825.43, "timestamp": "01:03:45", "text": "年度最佳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3829.109, "timestamp": "01:03:49", "text": "我真希望我能做到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3835.91, "timestamp": "01:03:55", "text": "乐趣。从某种意义上说，那会很有趣。我猜"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3838.853, "timestamp": "01:03:58", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "meow"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3838.87, "timestamp": "01:03:58", "text": "如果我这样想，我就能做到。"}]